 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "BookSalesTracker() starts empty. recordSale(bookId, quantity) adds quantity (positive) to the cumulative sales of bookId, creating it when new. getTopK(k) returns the ids of the min(k, number of books) books with the highest cumulative sales, highest first, ties by ascending id (code point), and changes nothing. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
